% Stratified shearing box, solar neighbourhood (TIGRESS R8-like), FIRE-3. Units pc, Msun, km/s (t_unit = 0.978 Myr).
% Resolution-dependent entries are marked [res]; values here are for 1e3 Msun cells.
InitCondFile                       tallbox_ics
OutputDir                          output
BoxSize                            1000
TimeBegin                          0
TimeMax                            1023         % 1 Gyr (~4.6 orbits at Omega = 28 km/s/kpc)
TimeBetSnapshot                    5            % ~5 Myr
TimeOfFirstSnapshot                0
TimeBetStatistics                  1
MaxSizeTimestep                    0.5          % ~0.5 Myr
MinSizeTimestep                    0
UnitLength_in_cm                   3.085678e18
UnitMass_in_g                      1.989e33
UnitVelocity_in_cm_per_s           1e5
UnitMagneticField_in_gauss         1
%---- external vertical gravity (GRAVITY_ANALYTIC_STRATIFIED_DISK): Kim & Ostriker 2017 R8
StratDisk_SigmaStar                42           % Msun/pc^2
StratDisk_ZStar                    245          % pc
StratDisk_RhoDM                    0.0064       % Msun/pc^3
StratDisk_R0                       8000         % pc
%---- gas / SF
InitGasTemp                        0            % from ICs
MinGasTemp                         10
InitRadiationTemp                  2.73         % RT_INFRARED (M1) builds: IR band starts at the CMB; the 20 K default fills the box with a blackbody
InitMetallicity                    1.0          % solar
InitStellarAge                     10.0         % Gyr (no pre-existing star particles; required tag)
DesNumNgb                          32
MaxNumNgbDeviation                 0.1
%---- softening [res]: gas is adaptive (= kernel radius), Type0 is its floor; stars ~ the gas kernel radius where they form.
%     1e3 Msun: gas floor 1 (never reached), stars 15. 10 Msun: gas floor 0.25, stars 3 (m^1/3 scaling)
Softening_Type0                    1
Softening_Type1                    10
Softening_Type2                    10
Softening_Type3                    10
Softening_Type4                    15
Softening_Type5                    15
Softening_Type0_MaxPhysLimit       1
Softening_Type1_MaxPhysLimit       10
Softening_Type2_MaxPhysLimit       10
Softening_Type3_MaxPhysLimit       10
Softening_Type4_MaxPhysLimit       15
Softening_Type5_MaxPhysLimit       15
%---- accuracy
ErrTolIntAccuracy                  0.01
CourantFac                         0.2
MaxRMSDisplacementFac              0.1
ErrTolForceAcc                     0.001
ErrTolTheta                        0.7
TreeDomainUpdateFrequency          0.01
%---- runtime
MaxMemSize                         3000
PartAllocFactor                    3.0
BufferSize                         100
TimeLimitCPU                       1e9
CpuTimeBetRestartFile              3600
ResubmitOn                         0
ResubmitCommand                    none
